* Speak to {n:Faulpie}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (E-8) (HP #4) for a cutscene.
* Trade {n:Faulpie} a {i:Buffalo Hide|Buffalo Hide|1628}, {i:Sheep Leather|Sheep Leather|850}, and 10,000 gil.
* Wait until the next game day to talk to {n:Faulpie} again who will give you a {i:Goblin Cutting|Goblin Cutting|1868} and instructions on how to craft it into a {i:Goblin Coif|Goblin Coif|15203}.
** Zoning is no longer required.
